  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### Added\n- **ProcessResult helper extensions** (`ProcessResultHelperExtensions`) – new extensions providing utilities for working with `ProcessResult` objects\n- **ProcessExceptionInfo class** – moved from main package to Core to improve exception type accessibility\n\n### Changed\n- **Dropped .NET Standard 2.0 support** – now targets .NET 8.0, .NET 9.0, and .NET 10.0 only; removed conditional compilation for .NET Standard compatibility\n- **ProcessTimeoutPolicy improvements** – refined timeout handling and policy application logic\n- **ProcessExitConfiguration refactoring** – improved constructor design and static helper methods for clearer API\n- **ExceptionInfo moved to Core** – `ProcessExceptionInfo` moved to Core package to allow downstream packages to reference exception details without depending on main CliInvoke package\n\n### Removed\n- **.NET Standard 2.0 target framework** – no longer supported in CliInvoke v3",
